Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:09.20,flashback,Zetsu,0,0,0,,Well, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.90,flashback,Shinobu,0,0,0,,I summon the the \NMobile Fortress, Castle-Golem!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.32,flashback,Zetsu,0,0,0,,Oof, that's your move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:18.35,flashback,Shinobu,0,0,0,,You've still got a lot to learn, Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:06.28,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Takasugi Jinzan of Chowshu... is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.28,0:02:08.30,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Zetsu the Assassin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:11.74,main,Yui,0,0,0,,The Mikagarigumi are supposed \Nto be defending Kyotow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:13.59,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,This is going to be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:15.12,main,Yui,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:17.84,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Chowshu was never the most \Npeaceful faction in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:18.82,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.29,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Since the Mikagarigumi work for the \Ngovernment, they're basically enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:24.91,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,It's not just Chowshu, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.06,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:28.67,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,The Satsumah domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:33.05,main,Yui,0,0,0,,They're pretty militaristic, right? \NI've heard about that Satsumah Hayato guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:38.26,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,It was one year ago that Chowshu \Nand Satsumah signed an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:44.23,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Rumor has it they're both \Nmoving troops towards Kyotow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:45.48,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Kyotow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:49.76,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't the shogun there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.04,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Things were tense enough before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.05,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,And now Takasugi Jinzan has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.27,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.03,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Hey, Ku...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:01.44,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.64,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:06.96,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough of all this, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:10.04,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Instead of worrying about stuff \Nthat's got nothing to do with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:11.34,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,you should be practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.79,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.75,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,That goes for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:21.75,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,If I catch you slacking, \NI can rescind your Kaiho rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.18,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:37.86,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I... I was a witness \Nfor an Eternal battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.55,main,Ku,0,0,0,,It was between Zetsu \Nand that Takasugi guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:47.21,main,Ku,0,0,0,,The two of them fought to\N the death because neither
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.42,main,Ku,0,0,0,,was willing to give up \Non what they were fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:53.66,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I always thought Battle Spirits \Nwas just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.76,main,Ku,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.48,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He died an honorable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:11.77,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.28,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Jinzan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:22.40,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,How many men can we mobilize?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.61,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Katsura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.70,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,We're going to raid this Bashin Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:30.90,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sir, Takasugi made me \Nswear to leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:38.09,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,You can simply follow my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.14,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I'm coming in, Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:54.23,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Zetsu's left Edoh already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:59.73,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Leaving without saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:04.49,flashback,Mine,0,0,0,,Ku really looks up to you. \NI'm sure you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.45,flashback,Zetsu,0,0,0,,All the more reason I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:11.75,flashback,Mine,0,0,0,,Come one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:19.75,flashback,Shie,0,0,0,,I asked Mr. Nishikiya about \Nthe person you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:25.33,top,Sign,0,0,0,,KO HAS JOINED THE KAIEITAI. \NSHOULD BE IN KYOTOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:25.33,flashback,Shie,0,0,0,,Since you helped Ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.02,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Then Zetsu's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.52,main,Mine,0,0,0,,He didn't leave that long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.52,main,Mine,0,0,0,,If you wanted to tell him something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.29,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:39.25,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Nah. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.61,main,Shie,0,0,0,,Ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.78,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Shizu, let's battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.78,top,Nobu,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.70,main,Kikutaro,0,0,0,,I get the feeling I'm not \Ngonna win if we go again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.70,top,Shizu,0,0,0,,Sure, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.36,main,Kenkichi,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about overhauling my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.36,top,Harunosuke,0,0,0,,Kosaku and Shizu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.17,main,Harunosuke,0,0,0,,This is gonna be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.29,main,Masa,0,0,0,,I noticed you were having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:06.04,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Your cost early on ended up \Naffecting you through the whole game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.91,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Is that what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.57,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:12.09,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Let's run through the game, and \NI'll explain what I think happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:13.09,main,Shizu,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.09,0:06:14.43,main,Masa,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.67,main,Kenkichi,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:16.56,main,Nobu,0,0,0,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.26,main,Natsu,0,0,0,,Come on, Yui, we can't miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.26,top,Kikutaro,0,0,0,,Let me watch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.49,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:28.92,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Ibuki's got a knack for teaching. \NHe'll make a great instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:30.33,main,Ku,0,0,0,,He mentioned before
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:35.67,main,Ku,0,0,0,,that he plays Battle Spirits to polish \Nthe skills he'll need as a headman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.69,top,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You know how by making \Nuse of reduction symbols,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:34.58,top,Ibuki,0,0,0,,you can increase your number of spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:36.08,top,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:42.18,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I guess he can see whatever it is\N that lies beyond Battle Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.90,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:58.44,main,Ku,0,0,0,,The Chowshu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:05.99,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure. My name is Katsura Koro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.64,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Katsura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:08.62,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.49,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,He commands Chowshu's troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.99,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,So, you're the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.95,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Can I help you gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:19.54,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak to Ajara Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.25,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you just missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.55,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We've surrounded the practice hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:29.39,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Even an ant won't be able to slip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.82,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,And there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.82,0:07:35.85,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,It's too late to help him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.08,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,No, it's too late \Nto keep him from leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:41.86,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, you can search \Nthe temple until you're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.57,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Don't get rough with any of the relics!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:58.01,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,You kinda look like you don't care \Nwhether or not Zetsu is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:59.86,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,What an odd thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:03.55,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I assure you, I want nothing more \Nthan to meet with Ajara Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.76,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:09.99,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think \Nthat you will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:16.35,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Jinzan and I were old friends, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:21.61,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,What did a young man like you \Nthink of his end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:25.29,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:31.05,main,Ku,0,0,0,,At the very end, he looked... \Nsatisfied, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:34.24,main,Ku,0,0,0,,He said that life had been interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:39.37,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I see. So, he passed on \Nwith a full heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:41.64,main,Ku,0,0,0,,How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:46.39,main,Ku,0,0,0,,How are you guys able to \Nrisk your lives so easily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:49.13,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Your interpretation's a bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:53.17,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,No life should be gambled carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:56.54,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,But we have a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:09:01.65,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,And that greater purpose is what \Njustifies us risking our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:09.78,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Do you have something like that? \NSomething you'd risk your life for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:18.70,top,sign,0,0,0,,BASHIN TEMPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.83,main,Tsuchimori,0,0,0,,There's no sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.83,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Didn't I say as much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:26.42,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Do you know where he's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:29.67,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Sure don't. He kinda just \Nwandered in here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.69,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,I suppose that's fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:37.05,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to make trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:39.65,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Especially in light \Nof what Jinzan promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:42.55,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,What's your name, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.81,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Bashin Ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:49.76,main,Kogoro,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching over \NJinzan's passing, Bashin Ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:53.69,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:54.55,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.19,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Get some salt and purify the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.94,main,Yui,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:00.11,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Katsura Koro...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.09,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Is this for the best, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:07.72,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,Events are already in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:10.75,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,We cannot afford to find \Nourselves delayed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:15.32,main,Katsura,0,0,0,,We need to seize Musuhinomiya. \NThat is why we dispatched men to Kyotow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.43,main,Kirihsima,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:18.96,main,Kirihsima,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.43,main,Kogoro,0,0,0,,Kirishima...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:26.74,main,Kogoro,0,0,0,,You're too fixated on Jinzan's death \Nand his killer, Ajara Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.65,main,Kirishima,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:33.08,main,Kogoro,0,0,0,,Granted, I understand your grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:47.00,main,Yui,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:51.39,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, it's times like this \Nthat we need to focus on practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.76,main,Yui,0,0,0,,You're playing me, Ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:00.43,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Not now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.52,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Yes, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.02,main,Mine,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:10.05,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Things seemed kind of dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:11.78,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,You mean with the men from Chowshu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:12.85,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:16.19,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,We just had a little chat and \Nthen they went on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.99,main,Mine,0,0,0,,If you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.24,main,Mine,0,0,0,,You can do this, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:23.50,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.03,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I take it on my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:27.00,main,Yui,0,0,0,,One more attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.67,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I take it on my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.48,main,Yui,0,0,0,,And I end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:31.93,main,Yui,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:34.84,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win in no time \Nif you don't get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:38.16,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I'm just... Look, don't get carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:42.14,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Start, core, draw, refresh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.47,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Main!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:46.20,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I use one of the EX symbols \Nin my trash as Legacy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:47.77,main,Ku,0,0,0,,and summon Purgatory Phoenix Zekuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:51.20,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Here we go! Ku's specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.21,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this around, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:55.19,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Attack, Zekuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:56.47,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Soul Awakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.78,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Forcing him out of his funk, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:03.05,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything. This was Yui's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.22,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:06.32,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,She's truly a doctor's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:09.33,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,She knows just what the best medicine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.76,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I attack again with Zekuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:14.76,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I take it on my life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.69,main,Shizu,0,0,0,,Oh, no. He's got her cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:18.97,main,Natsu,0,0,0,,That's Ku for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:20.91,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:25.06,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Start, core, draw, refresh, main...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.43,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Luminous Recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:29.50,main,Yui,0,0,0,,That brings my life back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.98,main,Shie,0,0,0,,The way she's fighting... \Nis just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:37.19,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Yui is doing a good job \Nof hanging on. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.40,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Attack! Soul Awakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.66,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.89,main,Ku,0,0,0,,But the effect of being in Ultimate Kaiho \Nstate means you lose one life point!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.42,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.26,main,Shizu,0,0,0,,Ku can attack again \Nbecause of Soul Awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.20,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Ku's got this in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.51,main,Ku,0,0,0,,All right, and with this attack \Nyour last life point will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.56,flashback,Katsura,0,0,0,,We have a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:13.56,flashback,Katsura,0,0,0,,And that greater purpose is what \Njustifies us risking our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:40.59,flashback,Katsura,0,0,0,,Do you have something like that? \NSomething you'd risk your life for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.65,main,Kenkichi,0,0,0,,That's what you'd expect \Nfrom Ku's deck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:44.05,main,Kosaku,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:45.43,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Focus up, Ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:49.34,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Yui isn't so weak that you can beat her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.96,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,while your head is somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.52,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Attack, Zekuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:14:00.03,main,Yui,0,0,0,,This is what I was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.99,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Flash! Dream Powder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:05.36,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.07,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:09.06,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Go ahead and slip Zekuga \Nback into your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:16.27,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Second main step... I summon \NZekuga again and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.21,main,Yui,0,0,0,,What are you focused on, Ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.57,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Because I'm the one in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:22.97,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:26.71,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Refresh, main...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:30.12,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I summon the Exotic Lithoid Giant, \NParaibatour, in Ultimate Kaiho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:35.05,main,Yui,0,0,0,,And it's Ultimate Kaiho effect \Nprevents you from blocking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.17,main,Shizu,0,0,0,,Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:38.30,main,Natsu,0,0,0,,Did she just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:42.82,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Yeah. Paraibatour uses \Ndouble symbols. Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.86,main,Yui,0,0,0,,You lose two life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.16,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Attack, Paraibatour!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.79,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.04,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Yui won!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.71,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Nice work, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:00.57,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Thank you for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:04.00,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Nicely played.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:07.42,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Being able to whip out \NParaibatour at the last second...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:10.29,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I guess I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:12.22,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:18.73,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,The best cards tend to respond \Nto the strength of your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:32.99,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Ku, do you know why I use this deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:38.47,main,Yui,0,0,0,,It's a white deck, \Nlike my mom always uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:41.76,main,Yui,0,0,0,,And it's got Luminous Recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.58,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Magic that lets you regain life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:49.57,main,Yui,0,0,0,,It reminds me of how \Ndoctors help heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:53.85,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Seeing my mom use a deck like that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:58.10,main,Yui,0,0,0,,makes me think that it's \Na deck that helps save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:01.61,main,Ku,0,0,0,,A deck that saves lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:05.93,main,Yui,0,0,0,,And that's why, \Nby using another white deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:09.51,main,Yui,0,0,0,,I think I might be able to \Nbecome a doctor like my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:12.47,main,Mine,0,0,0,,Yui...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.71,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Not that I know how long \Nit'll take, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:19.30,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:23.17,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,When you've got a lofty goal like that, \Nyou should sound prouder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:30.49,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,While samurai kill each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:34.29,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,You have some people who play \NBattle Spirits to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:37.43,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Everyone's feelings towards \Nthe game are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:48.39,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Ku, who's the only one who can \Ndeal with the doubts you're feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:50.84,main,Ku,0,0,0,,What is this? A zen riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.74,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Just answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.54,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.09,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:03.96,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Then you do know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.14,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,I told you as much before, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.43,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,The only one who can fill up \Nyour empty vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:12.89,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:18.24,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Right now, you should \Nconsider what to fill it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:21.23,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,That is a decision only you can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.05,main,Ku,0,0,0,,It's all up to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:30.56,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Shie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:33.11,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where Zetsu went?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.12,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Whoa, Ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.12,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:42.25,main,Shie,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:47.30,main,Ku,0,0,0,,The way he feels about Battle Spirits... \NI want to see where it leads him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:51.47,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I get the feeling that's how \NI'll find the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:53.29,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Ku...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:03.73,main,Ku,0,0,0,,The person Zetsu is looking for, Ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.70,main,Ku,0,0,0,,is living among the Kaieitai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:09.65,main,Ku,0,0,0,,In Kyotow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:13.45,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,The Kaieitai?! Sakamoto Ryoga's company?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:15.36,main,Mine,0,0,0,,They've made their fortune recently
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:19.45,main,Mine,0,0,0,,by trading with foreign countries \Nand transporting goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.99,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Sakamoto Ryoga, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:26.46,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,They say he's the one who \Nmediated the Sat-Chow alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:30.76,main,Yui,0,0,0,,But aren't those Sat-Chow guys \Nsending their troops to Kyotow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.97,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,That city has become a powder keg,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:35.72,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,with forces for and against \Nthe shogunate circling each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:41.69,main,Yui,0,0,0,,And he's going to wade into the middle \Nof all that to see this Ko person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:44.03,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Did you hear all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:45.23,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:48.03,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I know you said to keep my distance, Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:50.57,main,Ku,0,0,0,,but I still want to see Zetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:51.53,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:56.39,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Going to Kyotow right now is like \Nwalking into the jaws of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.24,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I'm still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.24,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Then you don't care if you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:04.06,main,Ku,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:06.26,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You're always like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:08.75,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You never consider the important things!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.49,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Just like how you play Battle Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:12.71,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Who're you to say what's important?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:21.86,main,Yui,0,0,0,,Fuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.01,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,I think he's saying, \Nif you've got time to ponder it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:35.88,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,you should take action instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:40.45,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I think animals have a better \Nunderstanding of things than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.92,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,I didn't give you the right to Kaiho
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.25,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,just out of respect \Nfor your Battle Spirits skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:50.77,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:54.88,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,It's your path. You decide where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:57.88,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.64,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Just promise me you won't \Ntackle it half-heartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.58,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.28,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Well, that being the case, \NI'm gonna be gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:08.78,main,Shie,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep practicing \NBattle Spirits while you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:09.81,main,Shie,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.89,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Yeah! When I get back, \Nwe can battle again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:14.15,main,Yui,0,0,0,,It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.90,main,Yui,0,0,0,,You had better come back in one piece, Ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.45,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:21.16,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Ibuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.30,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Don't forget to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:26.66,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,And don't you dare lose your touch \Nand disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:29.61,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.93,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Battle Spirits can't \Njust be about winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:35.67,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Use this as a chance to \Nthink about that some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:36.93,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.44,main,Ku,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.94,main,Yui,0,0,0,,You're going too, Fuku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.54,main,Mine,0,0,0,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:08.82,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:10.31,main,Suiboku,0,0,0,,Right, Ibuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:12.67,main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:35.02,top,sign,0,0,0,,KYOTOW
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.36,main,Spy,0,0,0,,Mr. Sasaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:04.05,main,Spy,0,0,0,,He has arrived in Kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:09.45,main,Spy,0,0,0,,Then he's returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:13.01,main,Spy,0,0,0,,Zetsu the Assassin!

